    {
      "text": "Is better to book in advance!",
      "atomId": "a-079",
      "classification": "NON_ITINERARY",
      "entities": [],
      "reason": "Booking advice."
    },
    {
      "text": "It has an amazing view of Puerto madero.",
      "atomId": "a-080",
      "classification": "NON_ITINERARY",
      "entities": [],
      "reason": "View description."
    },
    {
      "text": "I also recommend this [36hs in Buenos Aires New York Times Guide](…).",
